[node name="Static" type="Node2D" parent="."]

; Four static squares boxing the subject. They are the only way to SEE
; screenshake — the camera moves, so a fixed reference in world space is what
; registers the displacement. Squares rather than bars because shake is 2D.
; Kept inside x[-140,310] y[-145,80], the region the UI panels do not cover.

